        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63217,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Fallopian tube (paratubal location)</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63218,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Paratubal cysts present as adnexal masses or cysts. They may become symptomatic if there is rapid enlargement, torsion, rupture, or haemorrhage {22526447}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63219,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The incidence is not certain but can be as high as 7.3% in paediatric and adolescent populations {22075350}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63220,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Paratubal cysts are considered to be derived from mesothelium or remnants of M&uuml;llerian (paramesonephric) duct.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63221,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63222,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Paratubal cysts are simple thin-walled fluid-filled cysts found between ovary and fallopian tube.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63223,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Paratubal cysts are lined by cuboidal or ciliated epithelium similar to that of the fallopian tube. They may rarely be the site of a cystadenoma, serous borderline tumour, or carcinoma {22526447; 28277338; 26026220}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63224,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 170,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:34:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
